# MBSNM colour system

## Proportions (visual weight across a page)

| Share | Name | Hex | Use |
|------:|------|-----|-----|
| 40% | Mbale Navy | `#16357F` | Header, footer, hero overlays, primary buttons, navy panels |
| 28% | Ivory | `#F4FAFB` | Page background, cards, open space |
| 16% | Service Green | `#198F34` | CTAs, success states, accent bands |
| 11% | Sky Blue | `#B5D9E5` | Callouts, chips, soft highlights (not `#B509E5`) |
| spare | Sunrise Gold | `#E8A317` | Eyebrows, icons, focus rings, hover emphasis — **never body text** |

Gold is accent-only. Do not use gold for paragraphs, form labels, or muted copy.

## Accessibility (WCAG AA)

- Normal text: **4.5:1** minimum contrast against its background.
- Large text (≥18px regular or ≥14px bold): **3:1** minimum.
- Prefer `--foreground` on ivory; use `--muted` only for secondary copy (token is AA-safe on ivory).
- On navy panels: use white, ivory, or sky blue for text — not gold for readable copy.

## UI components

- **Buttons**: pill shape (`rounded-full` / `.btn-pill` / `Button` component).
- **Callouts**: sky background with a **navy left edge marker** — use `.callout-sky` or `Callout` component.
- Avoid large gold section bands; keep `.section-gold` / `.section-warm` rare.

## Tokens

Defined in `src/app/globals.css`: `--primary` (navy), `--brand-ivory`, `--brand-green`, `--brand-sky`, `--brand-yellow`.
